  "tourFirstWordDesc": "(Funguo za Aya)\n\nDhibiti hali ya (Neno la Kwanza) la kila mstari kwenye ukurasa ili kuunganisha mwanzo wa mistari:\n- Ficha neno la kwanza\n- Onyesha neno la kwanza",
  "tourLastWordDesc": "(Mwisho wa Aya)\n\nDhibiti hali ya (Neno la Mwisho) la kila mstari kwenye ukurasa ili kurekebisha miisho ya mistari:\n- Ficha neno la mwisho\n- Onyesha neno la mwisho",
  "tourAyahNumberTitle": "Nambari ya Aya",
  "tourWeak": "Dhaifu",
  "tourAyahColorsTitle": "Rangi za Ukadiriaji wa Kukariri",
  "tourAyahNumberDesc": "Bofya kwenye nambari ya Ayah ili kufikia vipengele vya kina:\n- Ukadiriaji wa nguvu ya kukariri:\n  • Dhaifu\n  • Kati\n  • Nzuri\n- Ongeza alamisho kwa aya\n- Tazama Mutashabihat na aya",
  "tourAyahColorsDesc": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; margin-top: 10px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 0.95em; color: #cbd5e1;\">Rangi ya nambari ya Ayah hubadilika kulingana na kiwango cha kukariri ulichoweka:</div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px;\">\n        <!-- Dhaifu -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); border: 2px solid #ef4444; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;\">\n                 <span style=\"color: #ef4444; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">🔴</span>\n            </ div>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: #ef4444;\">Dhaifu</span>\n        </ div>\n        \n        <!-- Kati -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.2); border: 2px solid #eab308; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;\">\n                 <span style=\"color: #eab308; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">🟡</span>\n            </ div>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: #eab308;\">Wastani</span>\n        </ div>\n\n        <!-- Nzuri -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); border: 2px solid #22c55e; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;\">\n                 <span style=\"color: #22c55e; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">🟢</span>\n            </ div>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: #22c55e;\">Nzuri</span>\n        </ div>\n    </ div>\n</ div>",
  "tourMedium": "Kati",
  "tourGood": "Nzuri",
  "tourSameSurah": "Sura sawa",
  "tourMutashabihatTitle": "Tahadhari za Mutashabihat",
  "tourMutashabihatDesc": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 5px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 0.85em; color: #cbd5e1;\">Mstari wa rangi huonekana chini ya nambari ya Ayah ili kuonyesha Mutashabihat:</div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: flex-start; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 8px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n        <!-- Ndani -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; width: 33%;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid #fbbf24;\">\n                 <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #fbbf24;\">🟡</span>\n                 <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -2px; kushoto: 15%; kulia: 15%; urefu: 2px; background-color: #22c55e; border-radius: 2px;\"></div>\n            </ div>\n        </ div>\n        \n        <!-- Nje -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; width: 33%;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid #fbbf24;\">\n                 <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #fbbf24;\">🟢</span>\n                 <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -2px; kushoto: 15%; kulia: 15%; urefu: 2px; background-color: #ef4444; border-radius: 2px;\"></div>\n            </ div>\n        </ div>\n\n        <!-- Wote -->\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; width: 33%;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 26px; height: 26px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid #fbbf24;\">\n                 <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #fbbf24;\">🔴</span>\n                 <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -2px; left: 15%; width: 35%; height: 2px; background-color: #22c55e; border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px;\"></div>\n                 <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -2px; kulia: 15%; upana: 35%; urefu: 2px; background-color: #ef4444; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;\"></div>\n            </ div>\n        </ div>\n    </ div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.75em; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 4px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,155;top;6px-top; padding) kituo;\">\n        <span><span style=\"color: #22c55e;\">● </span> Sura ile ile</span>\n        <span><span style=\"color: #ef4444;\">● </span> Sura Nyingine</span>\n        <span><span style=\"color: #fbbf24;\">● </span> Zote</span>\n    </ div>\n</ div>",
